{"availability":"available","full":"kovdanielgh/rounds","name":"rounds","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Solidity","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-09T23:52:21Z","updated":"2026-10-13T21:57:31Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://saverounds.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://saverounds.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:34.073Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:34.073Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:34.073Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:06:47.060Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T05:05:34.073Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Save in dollars. Pick a side on BTC. Your deposit always comes back.","Rounds runs short rounds on Monad. Your deposit earns yield. The yield of the round trades your idea on Perpl, an on-chain order book. If the idea is correct, three depositors share the prize. If it is wrong, you lose nothing: you get your deposit back, plus base yield.","Live app: saverounds.vercel.app · Network: Monad testnet (chain 10143) · Demo video: add link"],"features":["The contract trades on an on-chain order book. One transaction fixes the strike and places a real order on Perpl. This needs a fast chain with a fully on-chain order book.","Short rounds are cheap. A 10-minute round costs a few transactions. Blocks are about 0.4 s.","A new round is a function call. All rounds live in one contract. Mirror pairs (Bullish and Bearish on the same blocks) show as one card.","I like monad ecosystem."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kovdanielgh/sava/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"27738dadfe61c8ef602631d8e07db968eb142c008b92df3724174bf77a67f3cf","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:47.138Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:47.138Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Save in dollars. Pick a side on BTC. Your deposit always comes back.","sourceUrl":"https://github